<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken increases 2002 bond amount.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken increases 2002 bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish borrower Hypotekbanken has raised the amount of its 1996/2002 four percent bond by 25 million crowns to 1.975 billion, arranger Gudme Raaschou said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bonds were sold, it added.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
